[00:10.64]1. From house to house, from door to door,
[00:16.10]Jehovah’s word we spread.
[00:20.94]From town to town, from farm to farm,
[00:25.84]Jehovah’s sheep are fed.
[00:30.88]The good news that God’s Kingdom rules,
[00:36.46]As Jesus Christ foretold,
[00:41.40]Is now declared throughout the earth
[00:46.28]By Christians young and old.
[00:56.94]2. From house to house, from door to door,
[01:02.42]Salvation we proclaim.
[01:07.26]It comes to those who make the choice
[01:12.04]To call upon God’s name.
[01:17.20]But how can they respect the name
[01:22.22]Of One they do not know?
[01:27.96]To ev’ry home and ev’ry door,
[01:32.52]The sacred name must go.
[01:45.48]3. So let us go from door to door
[01:51.08]To spread the Kingdom news.
[01:56.26]And whether it’s embraced or not,
[02:01.26]We’ll let the people choose.
[02:06.00]At least we’ll name Jehovah’s name,
[02:11.12]His glorious truth declare.
[02:16.20]And as we go from door to door,
[02:21.86]We’ll find his sheep are there.
